[{"title":"红拂妓图","author":"唐寅","text":"杨家红拂识英雄，着帽宵奔李卫公。\n莫道英雄今没有，谁人看在眼睛中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观瀑图","author":"唐寅","text":"一派银河倾碧落，耳根于此洗尘嚣。\n要知尽日支吾处，五老峰前三峡桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"讽炼金方士","author":"唐寅","text":"破衣衫中破布裙，逢人便说会烧银。\n君何不自烧些用，担水河头卖与人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"齐后图","author":"唐寅","text":"百二关河狼虎秦，连环难解献高臣。\n若非纤手抽刀斩，应笑山东后有人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛友","author":"唐寅","text":"学佛俄经二十年，于今地上拥青莲。\n我来愿结三生友，共看当时手指天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画（十八首） 其十 李端端落籍图","author":"唐寅","text":"善和坊里李端端，信是能行白牡丹。\n谁信扬州金满市，元来花价属穷酸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏林春燕","author":"唐寅","text":"燕子归来杏子花，红桥低影绿池斜。\n清明时节斜阳里，个个行人问酒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏林春燕","author":"唐寅","text":"红杏梢头挂酒旗，绿杨枝上转黄骊。\n鸟声花影留人住，不赏东风也是痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹图","author":"唐寅","text":"谷雨花枝号鼠姑，戏拈彤管画成图。\n平康脂粉知多少，可有相同颜色无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹图","author":"唐寅","text":"故事开元重牡丹，沉香亭北冷泉南。\n如今颜色还依旧，风雨江东月润三。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹图扇面","author":"唐寅","text":"倚槛娇无力，临风香自生。\n旧时姚魏种，高压洛阳城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉仕女图","author":"唐寅","text":"佳人名字号经莲，能事挡弹五十弦。\n自是欲将花比貌，凉风轻步野塘边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":660,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题芭蕉仕女","author":"唐寅","text":"兽额朱扉小院深，绿窗含雾静愔愔。\n有人独对芭蕉坐，因为春愁不放心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":661,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉仕女图","author":"唐寅","text":"佳人春睡倚含章，一瓣梅花点额黄。\n起对镜自添百媚，至今都学寿阳妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":662,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花降图","author":"唐寅","text":"窗满蕉荫小洞天，香风时度竹栏边。\n东君管领春无价，笑倩金蓬上玉肩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":663,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花降图","author":"唐寅","text":"夜雨巫山不尽欢，两头颠倒玉龙蟠。\n寻常乐事难申爱，添出余情又一般。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":664,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花降图","author":"唐寅","text":"风暖香消翠帐柔，相逢偏喜得春稠。\n怜卿自是多情者，犹有多情在后头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":665,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花降图","author":"唐寅","text":"逐逐黄蜂粉蝶忙，雕栏曲处见花王。\n春心自是应难制，做出风流滋味长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":666,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花降图","author":"唐寅","text":"江南春色莺花老，又汲新泉浸芰荷。\n春色后先君莫讶，后头花更得春多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花降图","author":"唐寅","text":"蜀锦缠头气若丝，风流不减瘦腰肢。\n多情犹恐春云坠，挨枕扶头倩小姬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花降图","author":"唐寅","text":"春色撩人不自由，野花满地不忘忧。\n多情为惜郎君力，暂借风流占上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"言志","author":"唐寅","text":"不炼金丹不坐禅，不为商贾不耕田。\n闲来写就青山卖，不使人间造孽钱！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":670,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佳人停板图","author":"唐寅","text":"仙娥记曲世无双，下直归来日满窗。\n随手托牙镂板在，低头不语暗寻腔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":671,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佳人停板图","author":"唐寅","text":"红莲锦袖曹刚手，珑板腰肢捉板歌。\n何事夜深还演艺，花前争奈月明何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":672,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佳人插花图","author":"唐寅","text":"春困无端压黛眉，梳成松鬓出帘迟。\n手拈茉莉腥红朵，欲插逢人问可宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":673,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和靖图","author":"唐寅","text":"约阁江梅远近山，一天风月绕柴关。\n休言鸟断人绝，觅句逋仙正不闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":674,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟蜀宫妓图","author":"唐寅","text":"莲花冠子道人衣，日侍君王宴紫徽。\n花开不知人已去，年年斗绿与争绯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":675,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"征鸿图","author":"唐寅","text":"白露蒹葭八月秋，征鸿又作稻粱谋。\n一群嘹呖相呼处，多在萍荒浅水洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":676,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"抱琴归去图","author":"唐寅","text":"抱琴归去碧山空，一路松声雨鬓风。\n神识独游天地外，低眉宁肯谒王公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":677,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"败荷鹡鸰图","author":"唐寅","text":"飞唤行摇类急难，野田寒露欲成团。\n莫言四海皆兄长，骨肉而今冷眼看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":678,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金阊送别图","author":"唐寅","text":"金阊杨柳麦尘丝，又送吾儿上路岐。\n若到长安见知己，为言贫甚转工诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":679,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金阊暮烟图","author":"唐寅","text":"霜前柿叶一林红，树里溪流极望空。\n此景凭谁拟何处，金阊亭下暮烟中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f