e75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯木竹石图","author":"唐寅","text":"翠竹并奇石，苍松留古柯。\n明窗坐相对，试问兴如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":687,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯木图","author":"唐寅","text":"枯木萧疏下夕阳，漫烧飞叶煮黄鲿。\n与君且作忘形醉，明日驱驰汗浣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":688,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栈道图","author":"唐寅","text":"栈道连云势欲倾，征人其奈旅魂惊。\n莫言此地崎岖甚，世上风波更不平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":689,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞山图卷","author":"唐寅","text":"吾闻淮水出桐山，古来贤哲产其间。\n君令自称亦私淑，渔钓须当借一湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":690,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞宾花女人携瓶图","author":"唐寅","text":"仙机变幻真难测，吕字分明现在哉。\n何事世人皆不识，尚留余与人猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":691,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞宾图","author":"唐寅","text":"黄衣冠子翠云裘，四海三山挟弹游。\n我亦嚣嚣好游者，何时得醉岳阳楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":692,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画（十八首） 其十二 相如涤器图","author":"唐寅","text":"琴心挑取